WEBVTT

00:00.945 --> 00:03.842
<i>[organ music]</i>
<i>[管风琴音乐]</i>

00:03.911 --> 00:11.014
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:17.842 --> 00:21.738
[snoring]
[打鼾]

00:21.807 --> 00:23.704
[alarm blaring]
[警报声]

00:23.773 --> 00:26.876
[wolf howling]
[狼嚎]

00:33.428 --> 00:34.532
- Pick me!
- Me!
- 选我吧！
- 我！

00:34.601 --> 00:35.601
Pick me!
选我吧！

00:35.669 --> 00:37.428
- Pick... pick Me!
- Me!
- 选择...选择我！
- 我！

00:42.359 --> 00:43.773
all: Aw.
全体：噢。

00:45.566 --> 00:47.773
[yawns]
[哈欠]

00:47.842 --> 00:49.532
[hissing]
[嘶嘶声]

00:51.945 --> 00:56.325
Ah, Esmeralda.
Good evening.
啊，埃斯梅拉达。
晚上好。

00:56.394 --> 00:59.325
<i>[spooky music]</i>
<i>[幽灵音乐]</i>

00:59.394 --> 01:06.394
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

01:08.842 --> 01:10.911
[clears throat]
[清嗓子]

01:16.635 --> 01:18.566
Wakey-wakes, Master.
醒醒吧，主人。

01:18.635 --> 01:22.359
The first blood of the day
is the most important.
今天的第一滴血
是最重要的。

01:22.428 --> 01:24.911
Huh?
Master?
啊？
掌握？

01:24.980 --> 01:26.945
[gasps]
[喘气]

01:28.601 --> 01:30.566
[hisses]
[sneezes]
[嘶嘶声]
[打喷嚏]

01:30.635 --> 01:32.152
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

01:32.221 --> 01:33.359
Oh, no.
哦，不。

01:33.428 --> 01:37.566
You've got a stuffy Nose-feratu.
你的鼻子不通气。

01:37.635 --> 01:39.635
[sneezes]
[打喷嚏]

01:39.704 --> 01:41.152
[hisses]
[嘶嘶声]

01:41.221 --> 01:42.635
[sneezes]
[打喷嚏]

01:42.704 --> 01:45.014
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

01:45.083 --> 01:48.635
We have to get you
to Dr. Calamari right away.
我们必须找到你
立即联系 Calamari 博士。

01:48.704 --> 01:51.601
<i>[eerie music]</i>
<i>[怪异音乐]</i>

01:51.669 --> 01:56.152
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

01:56.221 --> 02:00.359
[breathing heavily]
[呼吸粗重]

02:00.428 --> 02:02.497
[sneezes]
[打喷嚏]

02:02.566 --> 02:04.014
[groans]
[呻吟]

02:04.083 --> 02:07.532
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:07.601 --> 02:09.049
[sneezes]
[打喷嚏]

02:11.049 --> 02:13.014
Next patient.
下一个病人。

02:13.083 --> 02:16.187
Salutations, Dr. Calamari.
问候，卡拉马里博士。

02:16.256 --> 02:20.428
The master has a case of
the Transylvanian sniff-sniffs.
大师有一个案例
特兰西瓦尼亚的嗅嗅。

02:20.497 --> 02:21.945
Can you help?
你能帮忙吗？

02:22.014 --> 02:23.394
[screeches]
[尖叫声]

02:23.463 --> 02:25.635
Thank you
for bringing him in, Slappy.
谢谢你
把他带进来，斯拉皮。

02:25.704 --> 02:29.428
I'll steam those allergies
right out of his schnoz.
我会消除那些过敏
就在他的鼻子里。

02:33.876 --> 02:35.290
[screeches]
[尖叫声]

02:35.359 --> 02:38.290
Come back in two hours
und pick him up.
两小时后回来
并接他。

02:38.359 --> 02:40.669
I'll be right back, Master.
我马上就回来，主人。

02:40.738 --> 02:43.773
Oh, I almost forgot.
哦，我差点忘了。

02:43.842 --> 02:46.945
[laughs]
[笑]

02:48.083 --> 02:51.359
[sneezes]
[打喷嚏]

02:51.428 --> 02:55.532
[growls]
[咆哮]

02:55.601 --> 02:57.669
Yes, Master.
是的，师父。

02:57.738 --> 03:02.738
I will bring you blood samples
und cookies.
我会给你带来血样
和饼干。

03:02.807 --> 03:04.428
Two hours?
两个小时？

03:04.497 --> 03:07.773
What am I gonna do
for two whole hours?
我要做什么
整整两个小时？

03:07.842 --> 03:11.394
Let's find out, eh?
Eh?
让我们来了解一下，嗯？
呃？

03:11.463 --> 03:15.773
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:15.842 --> 03:18.704
<i>[electronic music]</i>
<i>[电子音乐]</i>

03:18.773 --> 03:22.221
Get ready to prance, prance
on your grave!
准备好腾跃吧，腾跃吧
在你的坟墓上！

03:22.290 --> 03:25.807
Oh, I just love to prance.
哦，我只是喜欢跳跃。

03:25.876 --> 03:27.738
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:27.807 --> 03:30.497
Oh, I feel so free and loose!
哦，我感到如此自由和放松！

03:30.566 --> 03:37.497
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:41.842 --> 03:43.152
[buzzer blares]
[蜂鸣器鸣响]

03:43.221 --> 03:46.601
Hooray!
I made a swish.
万岁！
我“嗖”地一声。

03:46.669 --> 03:50.221
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

03:50.290 --> 03:53.566
Step right up
and squirt yourself a prize!
向右走一步
并给自己喷一个奖品！

03:53.635 --> 03:55.463
[laughs]
Yeah!
[笑]
是啊！

03:55.532 --> 03:56.601
Ooh!
哦！

03:56.669 --> 03:58.083
We have a winner!
我们有赢家了！

03:58.152 --> 04:00.256
Winner, winner!
赢家，赢家！

04:00.325 --> 04:02.566
Step right up
and squirt yourself a prize!
向右走一步
并给自己喷一个奖品！

04:02.635 --> 04:05.842
Oh!
Reach for the sky, bottles.
哦！
伸手向天空，瓶子。

04:05.911 --> 04:08.014
Whoa!
Ah! Oh!
哇！
啊!哦！

04:08.083 --> 04:10.152
Step right up, and squ...
直接站起来，然后...

04:12.187 --> 04:14.014
[explosion]
[爆炸]

04:14.083 --> 04:15.566
[all cheer]
[大家欢呼]

04:17.014 --> 04:19.187
We have another winner.
我们还有另一个赢家。

04:19.256 --> 04:22.152
[laughs]
Uh-oh.
[笑]
呃哦。

04:28.290 --> 04:29.980
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

04:30.049 --> 04:32.221
[loud thud]
[巨响]

04:32.290 --> 04:34.359
Oh, hello, Slippy.
噢，你好，滑溜。

04:34.428 --> 04:37.669
You look positively disgusting
this evening.
你看起来确实很恶心
今天晚上。

04:37.738 --> 04:41.152
[wheezing laugh]
[喘息笑声]

04:41.221 --> 04:45.911
You look pretty horrifying
yourself, Slappy.
你看起来很可怕
你自己，斯拉皮。

04:45.980 --> 04:49.394
[laughs]
[笑]

04:49.463 --> 04:52.394
[laughter]
[笑声]

04:53.704 --> 04:56.152
What can I get you today?
今天我能给你什么？

04:56.221 --> 04:58.359
Oh, I need a can of bat food
哦，我需要一罐蝙蝠食物

04:58.428 --> 05:01.152
and a flea collar
for the master.
和一个除蚤项圈
为了主人。

05:01.221 --> 05:04.566
Oh, that master sure is lucky
呵呵，这位主人真是幸运啊

05:04.635 --> 05:07.704
to have you looking out for him.
让你照顾他。

05:07.773 --> 05:10.428
Oh.
[chuckles]
哦。
[笑声]

05:10.497 --> 05:12.394
What do I owe you, gruesome?
我欠你什么，可恶？

05:12.463 --> 05:13.497
Shh.
嘘。

05:13.566 --> 05:17.152
It's on the house, stink lips.
就在房子里，嘴唇很臭。

05:19.428 --> 05:22.842
Until our eyes
cross again, <i>mon cheri.</i>
直到我们的眼前
再次穿越，<i>mon cheri。</i>

05:22.911 --> 05:25.842
<i>[romantic music]</i>
<i>[浪漫音乐]</i>

05:25.911 --> 05:27.876
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

05:27.945 --> 05:29.773
<i>[record scratches]</i>
<i>[记录划痕]</i>

05:32.152 --> 05:35.014
Excuse me.
Do you sell snail diapers?
打扰一下。
有卖蜗牛尿布的吗？

05:35.083 --> 05:37.876
- [meows]
- Ew.
- [喵]
- 呃。

05:37.945 --> 05:40.807
Ah, it is always great to go
啊，去总是很棒的

05:40.876 --> 05:43.842
on a picnic with old friends.
和老朋友去野餐。

05:43.911 --> 05:46.359
Oh, Mr. Ribeye?
哦，肋眼先生？

05:46.428 --> 05:49.118
Mr. Ribeye,
do you have the time?
肋眼先生，
你有时间吗？

05:50.601 --> 05:53.945
Oh, I have to pick up
the master.
哦，我得去接
主人。

05:54.773 --> 05:59.497
See you soon, everyone,
but hopefully not too soon.
大家好久不见
但希望不会太快。

05:59.566 --> 06:01.187
[laughs]
[笑]

06:01.256 --> 06:02.394
- Bye!
- Bye!
- 再见！
- 再见！

06:02.463 --> 06:04.256
- See you later, Slappy!
- See you!
- 再见，斯拉皮！
- 再见！

06:04.325 --> 06:05.566
Come back soon!
快回来吧！

06:08.187 --> 06:11.187
- Nosferatu.
- Nosferatu.
- 诺斯费拉图。
- 诺斯费拉图。

06:11.256 --> 06:14.945
Dr. Calamari, I'm back.
卡拉马里博士，我回来了。

06:15.014 --> 06:18.773
Nosferatu.
Nosferatu.
诺斯费拉图。
诺斯费拉图。

06:18.842 --> 06:22.738
So tell me, Doctor,
is the master cured?
所以告诉我，医生，
主人痊愈了吗？

06:22.807 --> 06:24.049
All better!
一切都好起来了！

06:24.118 --> 06:27.428
Make sure he takes these
nose drops twice a night.
确保他拿走这些
每晚滴两次鼻涕。

06:27.497 --> 06:30.738
Oh, thank you, Dr. C.
哦，谢谢你，C 博士。

06:30.807 --> 06:33.463
Who was a good vampire?
谁是一个善良的吸血鬼？

06:33.532 --> 06:34.945
Hmm?
唔？

06:35.014 --> 06:38.118
[slurping]
[发出声音]

06:39.704 --> 06:41.773
[chuckles]
[笑声]

06:41.842 --> 06:44.738
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

06:44.807 --> 06:49.152
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

06:49.221 --> 06:51.601
Oh, yes, of course I bought you
哦，是的，我当然买了你

06:51.669 --> 06:54.635
that flea collar
you saw in the window.
那个跳蚤项圈
你在窗户里看到的。

06:54.704 --> 06:56.773
[laughs]
[笑]

06:56.842 --> 06:58.773
Very fetching, Master.
太有魅力了，师父。

07:00.911 --> 07:02.532
Huh?
啊？

07:02.601 --> 07:05.566
I'll put that
in the fridge for later.
我会把那个
放在冰箱里待会儿用。

07:05.635 --> 07:07.773
[grumbles]
[抱怨]

07:07.842 --> 07:10.463
Oh, you don't have
to thank me, Master.
哦，你没有
来感谢我，师父。

07:10.532 --> 07:15.187
You're my best friend.
[laughs]
你是我最好的朋友。
[笑]

07:15.256 --> 07:17.187
Oh!
哦！

07:17.256 --> 07:20.359
Yes, Master!
Let's go home now.
是的，师父！
我们现在回家吧。

07:20.428 --> 07:25.290
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

07:25.359 --> 07:27.290
First one to the castle
第一个到城堡的

07:27.359 --> 07:31.256
is a filthy, stinking cesspool
of despair!
是一个又脏又臭的污水池
绝望！

07:31.325 --> 07:38.083
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

07:38.152 --> 07:39.497
Huh?
啊？

07:41.014 --> 07:45.152
I am soaring like a bat!
Soaring!
我像蝙蝠一样翱翔！
飙升！

07:45.221 --> 07:46.394
Oh!
哦！

哦！